Handle [Neon]: 
Welcome to the net, Neon.

Neo-Tokyo, 2087. In sector 7, acid rain makes the neon signs hum, and a toxic mist clings to the streets between the free clinics and the underground markets.
In a ten-square-meter studio, an old cyberdeck boots up on its own. The fan spins up. The screen paints the walls the color of a bruise.
Press Enter to continue, or type `skip` to go straight to the end of the introduction.
[Enter] to continue

Nexus Corp runs the city from its tower in sector 1. Down here, its Aurora Dawn clinics fit a free implant, the Halcyon, and the neighbors swear they have never rested so well.
The corporations keep the sky, the underground keeps the shadows, and the net keeps the rest. A deck, a connection and the habit of staying awake: that is all it takes to be called a hacker.
[Enter] to continue

Encrypted channel number 7: incoming connection.
ECHO-7: Finally. For the record, I'm not a corp, not a cop and not a trap. I'm ECHO-7, and yours is the only deck in sector 7 that still answers.
ECHO-7: Handle on file: Neon. Until you earn another name, you're a rookie. Don't take it personally.
ECHO-7: I have a first job for you. Nothing dangerous: a walk around your own deck. But first, the ropes.
Start the guided tutorial? ECHO-7 walks through the first commands, and `tutorial skip` ends it at any time. [Y/n] 
New quest: <draft>
ECHO-7: First thing, rookie: know your tools. Ask the deck what it can do.
Tutorial, step 1 of 10: Type `help` to list the open commands.
> help
Commands
1. Command: help; Effect: List the commands, or explain one
2. Command: status; Effect: Show your situation
3. Command: quit; Effect: Save and leave the net
4. Command: quests; Effect: Show the journal, or the objectives of one quest
5. Command: contacts; Effect: List the contacts you know
6. Command: talk; Effect: Talk to a contact
7. Command: net; Effect: Show the map of the net, or one site
8. Command: hack; Effect: Start a run on a known site
9. Command: laylow; Effect: Lower your Notoriety with a service
10. Command: hint; Effect: Ask ECHO-7 for a hint
11. Command: save; Effect: Save the game in a slot
12. Command: tutorial; Effect: Show, skip or restart the guided tutorial
Objective done: <draft>
ECHO-7: Then know your own file: handle, money, Notoriety. I keep the same three on you.
Tutorial, step 2 of 10: Type `status` to see the situation.
> quit
Leave the net? The game is saved. [y/N] y
Goodbye, Neon.
